        "content": "Post-earnings breakdown, Day 2 (May 1, 2026). Price recovered ~$10 from the April 30 intraday low of $600 to ~$611\u2013612. Indicators show the initial capitulation impulse is easing (hourly RSI 24.16 vs 14.7 prior; hourly -DI 49.52 vs 55.14 prior) but the trend remains firmly bearish. Conditional short entry zone unchanged: wait for dead-cat bounce to **$626\u2013630** (Fib 38.2% + broken prior support) with a rejection candle. Shorting at current price yields <1:1 R/R \u2014 fails the 2:1 minimum (source: decisions.json, signals_combined.json, run 20260501_142327).",
